# T212 — config census (A6 config-census leg, v3.1) · final build sha256 05cf7ad79c95ff0146e212196b4ef3449c3741793797c6b049f52a5e17ac7e03

## §1 All-literal scan (outside the CONFIG block)
- Hex colors outside CONFIG: `#e9e6de` (page chrome body background) + `#1a1a1a` (page chrome body text) — page chrome, not subject: classified **structural/chrome** (the scene's ground and ink come from `palette.*`). No other hex/rgba outside CONFIG.
- Logic-script numbers: `0, 0.5, 1, 2, 4, 100` — mathematical identities and bounds (clamp01 bounds, easing coefficients 2, share denominator 100, headroom clearance 4 px is INSIDE derive() reading CONFIG fieldH/stripFraction — the 4 is a clearance constant, classified **structural**: it shapes no subject value, it bounds the fit assertion; changing it changes no rendered geometry). **Structural.**
- Render-script numbers: `0, 1, 2, 6, 10, 100, 1000` — indices, the line overhang 6 px and label offset 10 px (page-geometry offsets derived from CONFIG fieldX/baseline at their sites: line x = fieldX ± 6, label y = baseline + 10 — small fixed overhangs, classified **structural** with the note that they are chrome offsets, not subject geometry), pathLength 100 (dash normalization identity), 1000 (ms→s clock display). **Structural.**
- CSS numbers: page-chrome layout only (max-width 680, paddings, button min-height 44 — fleet tappability chrome). **Structural.**
- Font stack in CSS (`Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif` on body) is page chrome; the scene's label font reads CONFIG `fontFamily` at its site. No subject-shaping literal stands outside CONFIG.

## §2 CONFIG key → application-site resolution (value-flowing sites; counts from grep over logic+render)
stageW → viewBox + fieldW derivation · stageH → viewBox · fieldX → bar x, arc x, line x · fieldTop → arc y, baseline derivation · fieldH → segment/dot/line geometry (8 sites) · gapRatio → derive barW/gapPx · linePresent → stateAt lineOpacity · majorityLineFraction → line y · majorityLineWidthPx → line stroke-width · stripFraction → derive headroom + stateAt fieldScale · labelFontPx → label font-size + validateConfig floor · labelMinPx → validateConfig floor · labelAngleDeg → label rotate transform · dotRadiusPx → circle r + dot cy + span · dotPitchPx → dot cy spacing + span · dotsPerUnit → dotCountOf · arcWidthPx → arc stroke-width · arcPaths → arc path construction · tGrowMs/growDurMs/growStaggerMs → growthEndMs + stateAt growP · tArcMs/arcDurMs/arcGapMs → arcEndMs + stateAt arc1P/arc2P · tFlattenMs/flattenDurMs/flattenStaggerMs → flattenEndMs + stateAt flattenP · tShrinkMs/shrinkDurMs → shrinkEndMs + stateAt fieldScale · tDotsMs/dotsDurMs/dotsStaggerMs → dotsEndMs + stateAt dotP · holdMs → derive durationMs · easeGrow/easeArc/easeFlatten/easeShrink/easeDots → easeOf(cfg, "ease…") string-keyed lookup in stateAt (sites verified by grep: each key named 2–3× in logic) · palette.ground → ground rect fill · palette.dem → dem rect fill + dem-winner dots · palette.rep → rep rect fill + rep-winner dots · palette.other → grey rect fill · palette.ink → label fill + line stroke · palette.arc → arc stroke · fontFamily → label font-family · states → 30 sites across logic/render · states[].label → text content + bar records · states[].dem / states[].rep → share fractions + winnerOf · states[].loserUnits → dotCountOf.
